{"title": "Gauntlets of the Warmaster", "pageid": 10892, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gauntlets_of_the_Warmaster", "categories": ["Gloves", "Very rare items", "Fighter set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gloves_of_Metal_E_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Faded.png/300px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/7/75/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Gauntlets of the Warmaster image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Faded.png/300px-Gloves_of_Metal_E_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Gloves_of_Metal_E_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Gauntlets of the Warmaster</span></a> are a very rare pair of <a href=\"/wiki/Handwear\" title=\"Handwear\">Gauntlets</a>. They grant their wielder +1 on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> and subject the targets of their <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master#Manoeuvres\" title=\"Battle Master\">Manoeuvres</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Clothing doesn't tend to have much personality. That comes down to how it's worn. Yet these gloves exude a confidence, an intangible aura of expertise.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" title=\"Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Gloves_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gloves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gloves\">Gloves</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" title=\"Medium Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/38px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/50px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Medium Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png/25px-Medium_Armour_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Medium_Armour_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Armour\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Medium Armour\">Medium Armour</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1600 gp / 1900 gpHHonour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1600  gp /  1900  gp<abbr title=\"Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">H</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Honour</sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_OfWarMaster_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfWarMaster_Gloves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfWarMaster_Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">85865321-5feb-447f-92e7-5c04359fe3af</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:85865321-5feb-447f-92e7-5c04359fe3af\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:85865321-5feb-447f-92e7-5c04359fe3af\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_OfWarMaster_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfWarMaster_Gloves+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_OfWarMaster_Gloves+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Gloves_Metal_E</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Attacks#Attack_rolls\" title=\"Attacks\">Attack rolls</a> +1</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Heightened_Manoeuvre\" title=\"Heightened Manoeuvre\">Heightened Manoeuvre</a></dt><dd>Targets have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a> against your <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master#Level_3\" title=\"Battle Master\">Manoeuvre</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Actions\">Weapon Actions</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Danthelon%27s_Dancing_Axe\" title=\"Danthelon's Dancing Axe\">Danthelon's Dancing Axe</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-10&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;143</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entharl_Danthelon\" title=\"Entharl Danthelon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png/25px-Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png/38px-Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png/50px-Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entharl Danthelon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png/25px-Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Portrait_Entharl_Danthelon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entharl_Danthelon\" title=\"Entharl Danthelon\">Entharl Danthelon</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This pair of gloves sells for more than any other in the game.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Heightened Manoeuvre:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The in-game description for <b>Heightened Manoeuvre</b> is arguably incomplete. It affects any action that uses the <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action DC\">weapon action DC</a> for its saving throw. This includes:\n<ul><li>Every <a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvre\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Manoeuvre\">manoeuvre</a></li>\n<li>Almost every <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon action</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Strike_(Unarmed)\" title=\"Stunning Strike (Unarmed)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/20px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/30px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/40px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunning Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/20px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Strike_(Unarmed)\" title=\"Stunning Strike (Unarmed)\">Stunning Strike</a> (both unarmed and weapon variants)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Water_Whip\" title=\"Water Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/20px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/30px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/40px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Water Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp/20px-Water_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Water_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Water_Whip\" title=\"Water Whip\">Water Whip</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Heightened Manoeuvre does not affect weapon actions that do not involve the weapon action DC. These actions include:\n<ul><li>Every <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Shot\" 